            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue! It should be primarily solved on latest `main` by allowing putting cursor past the end of line.\r\n\r\nNot without some issues (like with `T` and target being last character in line cursor is placed *on* the target if can't be positioned to the right of it), but it does seem like a more coherent behavior. In fact, it is now aligned with 'clever-f' (from which final solution to this issue was taken).",
